{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "378719a6-088f-87d6-af0d-a71f35318452",
  "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:02:52-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Vincent Cirelli",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T12:00:13-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T12:00:18-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. I want to report a problem with the road. Pothole, and the edge of the road is breaking."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T12:00:26-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can take that. Where is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T12:00:30-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is near my house, 381 Bliss Road. By the Easton's Beach side. There is a curve there, and the edge of the road is crumbling at the curve."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T12:00:41-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "381 Bliss Road, okay. And the pothole, is it right at that edge?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T12:00:47-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, right at the edge. Pavement is coming apart and there is hole next to it. Now with the rain it is full of water. You cannot see it. Car goes in and you only know when the wheel hits."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T12:01:03-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's the problem with these when it's pouring out. They look like a puddle. Have you seen anybody hit it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T12:01:12-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I did not see. I almost hit it myself this morning. [pause] I am driving slow now there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T12:01:20-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good idea. Let me get this down. Curve on Bliss Road near 381, edge crumbling, water-filled pothole. Is it on your side of the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T12:01:30-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, my side. Right in front of the house, little bit before the curve ends."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T12:01:36-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'll be honest, with the storm coming through today the crews are going to be busy with other things, and they can't really patch in the wet anyway. But I'll put it on the list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T12:01:50-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Please add the street to the repair list. I want it to be fixed when weather is better."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T12:01:58-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Done, it's on there. Do you want a call back, or are you fine just leaving it with me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T12:02:06-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Call back is not needed. But if you need, my number is 401-555-0160."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T12:02:12-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0160. Anything else going on at the house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T12:02:17-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One more thing. I just got new couch, and old couch is on the curb now. It is there in front of the house. Is it a problem if it stays in the rain?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T12:02:30-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bulky items usually go through a separate pickup. That's handled by the trash and recycling folks, so I'd call their line, or I can transfer you over if you want."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T12:02:42-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, transfer please. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T12:02:45-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure thing. Hold on one second, and be careful on that curve."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T12:02:50-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you, goodbye."
    }
  ],
